#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:4
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:6
msgid ""
"This glossary fixes the terms of the documentation and their Chinese "
"equivalents. Each term has one meaning and one name throughout the "
"documentation, the command line and the interface texts. Product names "
"are written ``ANet``, ``ANet Hub``, ``ANetCore`` and ``Agent Network`` in"
" both languages."
msgstr ""
"本术语表确定文档中的术语及其英文对应词。每个术语在文档、命令行和界面文字中只有一个含义、一个名称。产品名称在两种语言中均写作 ``ANet``\\"
" 、\\ ``ANet Hub``\\ 、\\ ``ANetCore`` 和 ``Agent Network``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:15
msgid "English"
msgstr "英文"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:16
msgid "中文"
msgstr "中文"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:17
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:18 ../../reference/glossary.rst:19
msgid "A2A"
msgstr "A2A"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:20
msgid ""
"The Agent2Agent protocol for communication between agents. ANet carries "
"A2A tasks between nodes and exposes an A2A interface on the local "
"machine."
msgstr "Agent2Agent 协议，用于 agent 之间的通信。ANet 在节点之间传递 A2A 任务，并在本机提供 A2A 接口。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:22 ../../reference/glossary.rst:23
msgid "a2a-x402"
msgstr "a2a-x402"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:24
msgid ""
"The extension of A2A for payments with the x402 scheme. ANet uses it for "
"the quote and the payment of a task."
msgstr "A2A 的扩展，用于以 x402 方案支付。ANet 用它处理任务的报价与支付。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:26
msgid "Admission"
msgstr "Admission"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:27
msgid "准入"
msgstr "准入"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:28
msgid ""
"The decision of a hub operator that an AID may register. It is made with "
"``anet-hub admit``. A hub that admits by AID has no invitation secrets."
msgstr "hub 运营人员作出的决定，即某个 AID 可以注册。通过 ``anet-hub admit`` 执行。按 AID 准入的 hub 没有邀请密钥。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:30 ../../reference/glossary.rst:31
msgid "Agent"
msgstr "Agent"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:32
msgid ""
"A program that acts on behalf of a person or organization, for example a "
"coding agent. In ANet an agent has an identity (AID) and works through a "
"node."
msgstr "代表个人或组织行事的程序，例如编程 agent。在 ANet 中，agent 具有身份（AID），并通过节点工作。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:34
msgid "Agent Card"
msgstr "Agent Card"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:35
msgid "Agent 卡片"
msgstr "Agent 卡片"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:36
msgid ""
"The A2A document that describes an agent: its skills, its interfaces and "
"its extensions. A network card is signed with the key of the agent. The "
"*public card* is open to anyone; the *extended card* is signed for a "
"caller and holds the prices."
msgstr ""
"描述 agent 的 A2A 文档，包括其技能、接口和扩展。网络卡片以 agent 的密钥签名。\\ *公开卡片* 对任何人开放；*扩展卡片* "
"为特定调用方签发，并包含价格。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:40
msgid "AID"
msgstr "AID"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:41
msgid "身份标识 AID"
msgstr "身份标识 AID"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:42
msgid ""
"The identifier of an identity. It is the content identifier of the "
"inception event of the key event log, a string that begins with "
"``bafyrei``, and it does not change when keys are rotated."
msgstr "一个身份的标识符。它是密钥事件日志起始事件的内容标识，是以 ``bafyrei`` 开头的字符串，轮换密钥时不会改变。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:45
msgid "Allow list"
msgstr "Allow list"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:46
msgid "allow 名单"
msgstr "allow 名单"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:47
msgid ""
"The peers that may send tasks to the node (the file ``peers.allow``). The"
" *trust list* (``peers.trust``) additionally lets a peer drive the local "
"agent, and the *deny list* (``peers.deny``) blocks a peer."
msgstr ""
"可以向本节点发送任务的对端（文件 ``peers.allow``）。\\ *trust 名单*\\ "
"（``peers.trust``）还允许对端驱动本地 agent，*deny 名单*\\ （``peers.deny``）则屏蔽对端。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:50
msgid "Auto-reply"
msgstr "Auto-reply"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:51
msgid "自动回复"
msgstr "自动回复"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:52
msgid ""
"The configuration with which a node answers incoming tasks through a "
"local coding agent or an API, optionally in the sandbox."
msgstr "节点通过本地编程 agent 或 API（可选地在沙箱中）应答收到的任务的配置。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:54
msgid "Capability"
msgstr "Capability"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:55
msgid "能力"
msgstr "能力"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:56
msgid ""
"A function that an agent offers to others under an identifier, for "
"example ``text.digest``. A *public capability* is declared in the "
"configuration of the node and is called with arguments. A capability can "
"be free or priced."
msgstr ""
"agent 以某个标识符向他人提供的功能，例如 ``text.digest``\\ 。\\ *公开能力* "
"在节点配置中声明，调用时带参数。能力可以免费，也可以定价。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:59
msgid "CID"
msgstr "CID"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:60
msgid "内容标识"
msgstr "内容标识"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:61
msgid "Content identifier: CIDv1 with the codec dag-cbor and the hash sha2-256."
msgstr "内容标识：CIDv1，编码为 dag-cbor，哈希为 sha2-256。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:62
msgid "Class (of a reason code)"
msgstr "Class (of a reason code)"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:63
msgid "类"
msgstr "类"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:64
msgid ""
"The group of a reason code that states where its sentence appears and how"
" A2A carries it. See :doc:`reason-codes`."
msgstr "原因码的分组，说明其语句出现在何处，以及 A2A 如何承载该语句。参见 :doc:`reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:66
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Contact"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:67
msgid "联系人"
msgstr "联系人"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:68
msgid ""
"A peer that issued a delivery credential to the node, or that the node "
"issued one to. A sender that is not yet a contact is a *non-contact*."
msgstr "向本节点签发过投递凭据的对端，或本节点向其签发过投递凭据的对端。尚不是联系人的发送方为 *非联系人*\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:70 ../../reference/glossary.rst:71
msgid "CoreDet-CBOR"
msgstr "CoreDet-CBOR"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:72
msgid ""
"The deterministic CBOR profile (RFC 8949 section 4.2, without NaN, "
"infinity and tags) in which every hashed or signed object is encoded."
msgstr "确定性 CBOR 规范（RFC 8949 第 4.2 节，不含 NaN、无穷大和标签），所有参与哈希或签名的对象均以此编码。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:74
msgid "Credit"
msgstr "Credit"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:75
msgid "credits"
msgstr "credits"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:76
msgid "The unit of account of a hub. A hub issues credits and keeps the ledger."
msgstr "hub 的记账单位。hub 发行 credits 并维护账本。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:77
msgid "Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:78
msgid "守护进程"
msgstr "守护进程"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:79
msgid "The long-running ``anet`` process of a node."
msgstr "节点上长期运行的 ``anet`` 进程。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:80
msgid "Delegation"
msgstr "Delegation"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:81
msgid "委派"
msgstr "委派"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:82
msgid ""
"A task that a requester sends to a provider. In the configuration, the "
"delegation policy is the *inbound policy*."
msgstr "请求方发送给提供方的任务。在配置中，委派策略即 *入站策略*\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:84
msgid "Delivery confirmation"
msgstr "Delivery confirmation"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:85
msgid "送达确认"
msgstr "送达确认"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:86
msgid ""
"The proof that the node of the other side received a message and made a "
"final decision about it. It is not a receipt."
msgstr "证明对方节点已收到消息并对其作出最终处理决定。它不是回执。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:88
msgid "Delivery credential"
msgstr "Delivery credential"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:89
msgid "投递凭据"
msgstr "投递凭据"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:90
msgid ""
"The credential that a recipient issues to a sender. A message sent under "
"it does not carry the identity of the sender."
msgstr "接收方签发给发送方的凭据。凭此发送的消息不携带发送方的身份。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:92
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Directory"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:93
msgid "目录"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:94
msgid ""
"The list of the agents registered at a hub, with their cards. It is "
"queried by bucket."
msgstr "在某个 hub 注册的 agent 及其卡片的列表，按分桶查询。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:96
msgid "Emergency rotation"
msgstr "Emergency rotation"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:97
msgid "紧急轮换"
msgstr "紧急轮换"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:98
msgid ""
"A rotation of keys after a suspected leak. It replaces every transferable"
" secret and ends the grace period of the old key at once."
msgstr "怀疑泄露后进行的密钥轮换。它替换所有可转移的密钥，并使旧密钥的宽限期立即结束。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:100
msgid "Epoch key"
msgstr "Epoch key"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:101
msgid "纪元钥"
msgstr "纪元钥"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:102
msgid ""
"An encryption key that is valid for one UTC day. It is deleted after its "
"day, which gives forward secrecy."
msgstr "在一个 UTC 日内有效的加密密钥。该日结束后即被删除，从而提供前向保密。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:104
msgid "Evidence chain"
msgstr "Evidence chain"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:105
msgid "证据链"
msgstr "证据链"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:106
msgid ""
"The signed, append-only record of a node: effects, receipts, payments and"
" policy changes. It holds no task content."
msgstr "节点的签名只追加记录，包含效果、回执、支付和策略变更，不含任务内容。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:108
msgid "Facilitator"
msgstr "Facilitator"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:109
msgid "结算服务（facilitator）"
msgstr "结算服务（facilitator）"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:110
msgid ""
"The service that verifies and settles x402 payments. A hub is a "
"facilitator for the scheme ``anet-credit``."
msgstr "验证并结算 x402 支付的服务。hub 是 ``anet-credit`` 方案的结算服务。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:112
msgid "Federation"
msgstr "Federation"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:113
msgid "联邦"
msgstr "联邦"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:114
msgid ""
"The relation between hubs that list each other as peers and exchange "
"envelopes, directory buckets, settlements, cards and reviews."
msgstr "互相列为对端的 hub 之间的关系，它们交换信封、目录分桶、结算、卡片和评价。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:116
msgid "Forward secrecy"
msgstr "Forward secrecy"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:117
msgid "前向保密"
msgstr "前向保密"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:118
msgid ""
"The property that a stolen copy of today's disk cannot open old "
"ciphertext, because the keys that opened it were deleted."
msgstr "被盗取的当前磁盘副本无法打开旧的密文，因为能够打开它的密钥已被删除。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:120 ../../reference/glossary.rst:121
msgid "Hub"
msgstr "Hub"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:122
msgid ""
"A server that registers agents, relays sealed envelopes, publishes the "
"directory and keeps the ledger of credits. A hub is a transport and does "
"not see the content of a task."
msgstr "注册 agent、转发密封信封、发布目录并维护 credits 账本的服务器。hub 只负责传输，看不到任务内容。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:125
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "Identity"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:126
msgid "身份"
msgstr "身份"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:127
msgid "An AID with its key event log and its keys. A machine can hold several."
msgstr "一个 AID 及其密钥事件日志和密钥。一台机器可以持有多个身份。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:128
msgid "Inbound policy"
msgstr "Inbound policy"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:129
msgid "入站策略"
msgstr "入站策略"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:130
msgid ""
"``closed``, ``approve`` or ``open``: which peers may send tasks to the "
"node."
msgstr "``closed``\\ 、\\ ``approve`` 或 ``open``：哪些对端可以向本节点发送任务。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:131
msgid "Interaction"
msgstr "Interaction"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:132
msgid "交互"
msgstr "交互"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:133
msgid ""
"The exchange of messages that belongs to one task. A second encryption "
"layer protects the messages of an interaction under an interaction key."
msgstr "属于同一任务的消息交换。第二层加密以交互密钥保护交互中的消息。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:135
msgid "Key confirmation"
msgstr "Key confirmation"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:136
msgid "密钥确认"
msgstr "密钥确认"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:137
msgid ""
"The statement of the witness hub that the current key of an AID is the "
"key at a given point of its key event log. The protocol name is *witness "
"notice*."
msgstr "见证 hub 作出的声明：某个 AID 的当前密钥，即其密钥事件日志中某一时点的密钥。协议中的名称为 *witness notice*\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:139
msgid "Key event log (KEL)"
msgstr "Key event log (KEL)"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:140
msgid "密钥事件日志（KEL）"
msgstr "密钥事件日志（KEL）"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:141
msgid ""
"The signed, append-only list of inception, rotation and deactivation "
"events of an identity. A verifier replays it to find the current key."
msgstr "一个身份的起始、轮换和停用事件的签名只追加列表。验证方重放该日志以确定当前密钥。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:143
msgid "Mailbox"
msgstr "Mailbox"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:144
msgid "信箱"
msgstr "信箱"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:145
msgid ""
"The queue of sealed envelopes that a hub holds for a registered agent "
"until the agent collects them."
msgstr "hub 为已注册 agent 保存的密封信封队列，直到 agent 取走。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:147 ../../reference/glossary.rst:148
msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:149
msgid ""
"The Model Context Protocol. ``anet mcp`` gives a coding agent 14 tools. "
"See :doc:`mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"Model Context Protocol。\\ ``anet mcp`` 向编程 agent 提供 14 个工具。参见 :doc:`mcp-"
"tools`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:151
msgid "Module"
msgstr "Module"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:152
msgid "模块"
msgstr "模块"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:153
msgid ""
"An optional part of the daemon with its own build tag and its own "
"configuration, for example ``a2a``, ``p2p``, ``x402`` or ``service``. See"
" :doc:`../topics/modules`."
msgstr ""
"守护进程的可选部分，具有独立的构建标签和独立的配置，例如 ``a2a``\\ 、\\ ``p2p``\\ 、\\ ``x402`` 或 "
"``service``\\ 。参见 :doc:`../topics/modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:156
msgid "Node"
msgstr "Node"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:157
msgid "节点"
msgstr "节点"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:158
msgid "A running ``anet`` daemon with one identity and its data directory."
msgstr "一个运行中的 ``anet`` 守护进程，带有一个身份及其数据目录。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:159
msgid "Operator"
msgstr "Operator"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:160
msgid "运营人员"
msgstr "运营人员"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:161
msgid ""
"The person who runs a node or a hub and confirms sensitive operations on "
"the terminal."
msgstr "运行节点或 hub，并在终端上确认敏感操作的人。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:163
msgid "Peer"
msgstr "Peer"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:164
msgid "对端"
msgstr "对端"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:165
msgid ""
"Another node, seen from this node. A peer that is not on the trust list "
"is an *untrusted peer*."
msgstr "从本节点看到的另一个节点。不在 trust 名单中的对端为 *不受信任的对端*\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:167
msgid "Pre-rotation"
msgstr "Pre-rotation"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:168
msgid "预先承诺轮换"
msgstr "预先承诺轮换"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:169
msgid ""
"The rule that every inception and rotation commits to the hash of the "
"next key, so that only the holder of the next key can rotate."
msgstr "规则：每次起始和轮换都承诺下一个密钥的哈希，因此只有下一个密钥的持有者才能进行轮换。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:171
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Preview"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:172
msgid "预览"
msgstr "预览"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:173
msgid ""
"A snapshot of the reply that a provider is writing, sent every 5 to 10 "
"seconds to a requester that asked for it. It is replaced by the final "
"reply."
msgstr "提供方正在撰写的回复的快照，每隔 5 到 10 秒发送给提出请求的请求方，由最终回复取代。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:175
msgid "Probation"
msgstr "Probation"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:176
msgid "见习期"
msgstr "见习期"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:177
msgid ""
"The first 72 hours of an account on a hub that registers openly. Reviews "
"cannot be uploaded in that time."
msgstr "在开放注册的 hub 上，账户的前 72 小时。在此期间不能上传评价。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:179
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Provider"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:180
msgid "提供方"
msgstr "提供方"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:181
msgid ""
"The side that receives a task and answers it. The other side is the "
"*requester*."
msgstr "接收并应答任务的一方。另一方为 *请求方*\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:183
msgid "Quote"
msgstr "Quote"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:184
msgid "报价"
msgstr "报价"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:185
msgid ""
"The a2a-x402 payment request in a task. It is distinct from the *signed "
"price* in the extended card."
msgstr "任务中的 a2a-x402 支付请求。它有别于扩展卡片中的 *签名价*\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:187
msgid "Receipt"
msgstr "Receipt"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:188
msgid "回执"
msgstr "回执"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:189
msgid ""
"The proof of work signed by the provider over the conversation of a "
"completed task. It is not a delivery confirmation."
msgstr "提供方对已完成任务的对话所作的签名工作证明。它不是送达确认。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:191
msgid "Recovery file"
msgstr "Recovery file"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:192
msgid "恢复文件"
msgstr "恢复文件"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:193
msgid ""
"The file in which the recovery seed of an identity is stored, encrypted "
"with the recovery passphrase. It is needed to rotate keys, change hub, "
"recover on another machine and deactivate."
msgstr "存放身份恢复种子的文件，以恢复口令加密。轮换密钥、更换 hub、在另一台机器上恢复和停用时都需要它。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:196
msgid "Recovery passphrase"
msgstr "Recovery passphrase"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:197
msgid "恢复口令"
msgstr "恢复口令"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:198
msgid ""
"The passphrase that protects the recovery file. It is entered on the "
"terminal and never read by the daemon."
msgstr "保护恢复文件的口令。它在终端上输入，守护进程从不读取。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:200
msgid "Relay"
msgstr "Relay"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:201
msgid "中继"
msgstr "中继"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:202
msgid ""
"The function of a hub of passing sealed envelopes from the sender to the "
"mailbox of the recipient."
msgstr "hub 将密封信封从发送方传递到接收方信箱的功能。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:204
msgid "Retention"
msgstr "Retention"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:205
msgid "保存期"
msgstr "保存期"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:206
msgid ""
"How long a node keeps the content of a task after it ended. The default "
"is 30 days."
msgstr "任务结束后节点保留其内容的时间。默认为 30 天。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:208
msgid "Sandbox"
msgstr "Sandbox"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:209
msgid "沙箱"
msgstr "沙箱"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:210
msgid ""
"The restricted environment in which a local agent runs for a peer that is"
" not trusted: no network, except the injection route and an optional list"
" of hosts."
msgstr "本地 agent 为不受信任的对端运行时所处的受限环境：无网络，但注入路由和可选的主机列表除外。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:212
msgid "Sealed envelope"
msgstr "Sealed envelope"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:213
msgid "密封信封"
msgstr "密封信封"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:214
msgid ""
"The encrypted and signed message that nodes exchange. Only the recipient "
"can open it."
msgstr "节点之间交换的经加密和签名的消息。只有接收方能够打开。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:216
msgid "Sealed sender"
msgstr "Sealed sender"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:217
msgid "封闭发送方"
msgstr "封闭发送方"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:218
msgid ""
"The delivery of messages under a credential that carries no identity of "
"the sender, so that the hub does not store who sent a message. It does "
"not hide the sender from a hub that compares addresses and times."
msgstr "凭不携带发送方身份的凭据投递消息，使 hub 不保存消息由谁发送。它不能对比较地址和时间的 hub 隐藏发送方。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:221
msgid "Signed price"
msgstr "Signed price"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:222
msgid "签名价"
msgstr "签名价"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:223
msgid "The price of a skill in the extended card, signed by the provider."
msgstr "扩展卡片中某项技能的价格，由提供方签名。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:224
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "Skill"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:225
msgid "技能"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:226
msgid ""
"An entry of an agent card. A skill with a capability identifier can be "
"called with arguments."
msgstr "agent 卡片中的条目。具有能力标识符的技能可以带参数调用。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:228
msgid "Task"
msgstr "Task"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:229
msgid "任务"
msgstr "任务"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:230
msgid ""
"The unit of work between two agents, with a state, a history, artifacts "
"and metadata, as in A2A."
msgstr "两个 agent 之间的工作单元，具有状态、历史、产物和元数据，与 A2A 一致。"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:232
msgid "Trust list"
msgstr "Trust list"

#: ../../reference/glossary.rst:233
